## 11. 中间件约束

Go 服务涉及下列中间件时，必须同时遵循 `../middleware/` 规范：

| 中间件 | 规范 | Go 推荐 |
|---|---|---|
| HTTP 客户端 | [`../middleware/api-client.md`](../middleware/api-client.md) | `net/http` + 自定义 `*http.Client`（**禁用 `http.DefaultClient`**：无超时） |
| 日志 | [`../middleware/logging.md`](../middleware/logging.md) | `log/slog` / `zap` |
| 鉴权 | [`../middleware/auth.md`](../middleware/auth.md) | `golang-jwt/jwt/v5` + middleware |
| Redis | [`../middleware/redis.md`](../middleware/redis.md) | `github.com/redis/go-redis/v9` |
| RocketMQ | [`../middleware/rocketmq.md`](../middleware/rocketmq.md) | `rocketmq-client-go/v2` |
| AI / LLM | [`../middleware/ai-llm.md`](../middleware/ai-llm.md) | 官方 HTTP SDK + 自封装（无官方成熟框架） |

